### ===================================================================
### PENGUJIAN OTOMATIS: "Satu Pasien, Satu Riwayat"
### Mandaya Royal Hospital Puri - 7 Kriteria Uji Terima
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. RESET DATABASE KE KONDISI AWAL DEMO
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/reset
Content-Type: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. UJI TERIMA 1: RESOLUSI MPI (30 BARIS MENJADI 9 PASIEN MPI)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mpi/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

### LIHAT HASIL PASIEN MPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mpi/patients

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. UJI TERIMA 2: MINIMAL 1 KASUS MASUK ANTREAN TINJAUAN (0.70 - 0.92)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mpi/review

### KEPUTUSAN TINJAUAN MANUAL (SETUJU GABUNG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mpi/review/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keputusan": "setuju",
  "petugas": "dr. Adrian Sp.JP"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. UJI TERIMA 3: DUA "AHMAD FAUZI" TIDAK BERGABUNG (2 PASIEN BERBEDA)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mpi/patients

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. UJI TERIMA 4: MATIKAN CONSENT PEMASARAN -> 403 FORBIDDEN & ACCESS LOG
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Langkah A: Matikan persetujuan pemasaran untuk MPI-0001
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/MPI-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "pemasaran",
  "diberikan": 0
}

# Langkah B: Panggil data pasien dengan peran marketing & purpose pemasaran -> Harap 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patient/MPI-0001?purpose=pemasaran
X-Peran: marketing
X-Aktor: Petugas CRM Marketing

# Langkah C: Periksa apakah percobaan akses tercatat di Access Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-log/MPI-0001

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. UJI TERIMA 5: MATIKAN SEMUA CONSENT -> PURPOSE=KLINIS TETAP 200 OK
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Langkah A: Matikan semua consent yang dapat dicabut
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/MPI-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "pengingat",
  "diberikan": 0
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/MPI-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "personalisasi",
  "diberikan": 0
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/MPI-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "analitik",
  "diberikan": 0
}

# Langkah B: Akses layanan klinis dengan peran dokter -> Tetap 200 OK (dapat_dicabut = 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patient/MPI-0001?purpose=klinis
X-Peran: dokter
X-Aktor: dr. Adrian Sp.JP

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. UJI TERIMA 6: 1 MPI_ID + 4 PERAN BERBEDA -> 4 PAYLOAD BERBEDA
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Payload 1: Dokter (Klinis Lengkap)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patient/MPI-0001?purpose=klinis
X-Peran: dokter

### Payload 2: Perawat (Klinis Asuhan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patient/MPI-0001?purpose=klinis
X-Peran: perawat

### Payload 3: Marketing (Non-Klinis Pemasaran) - aktifkan consent dulu jika ingin 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/MPI-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "pemasaran",
  "diberikan": 1
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patient/MPI-0001?purpose=pemasaran
X-Peran: marketing

### Payload 4: AI / Analitik (Pseudonim SHA-256 mpi_hash, kelompok usia)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/MPI-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "analitik",
  "diberikan": 1
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patient/MPI-0001?purpose=analitik
X-Peran: ai

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. UJI TERIMA 7: MAJUKAN HARI SIMULASI 3X -> PASIEN MUNCUL DI RISK QUEUE
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hari +1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/advance-day

### Hari +2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/advance-day

### Hari +3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/advance-day

### PERIKSA ANTREAN PASIEN BERISIKO TINGGI DENGAN ALASAN EKSPLISIT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/risk/queue

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. VERIFIKASI DATA LATIH AI (CLOSED LEARNING LOOP)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/training-data

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. VERIFIKASI RESOURCE FHIR R4 KANONIKAL
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/fhir/Patient/MPI-0001
